<view class="container">
  <view class="about-header">
    <view class="app-icon">💊</view>
    <view class="app-name">银领时代</view>
    <view class="app-version">V1.0.0</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="about-desc">
      银领时代是一款专为异地子女打造的智能药箱管理小程序。通过连接智能药箱，您可以远程管理父母的用药计划，实时查看服药状态，接收紧急求助通知，让关爱跨越距离。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">核心功能</view>
    <view class="feature-item" wx:for="{{features}}" wx:key="icon">
      <view class="feature-icon">{{item.icon}}</view>
      <view class="feature-info">
        <view class="feature-name">{{item.name}}</view>
        <view class="feature-desc">{{item.desc}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">法律信息</view>
    <view class="legal-item" bindtap="openPrivacy">隐私政策</view>
    <view class="legal-item" bindtap="openTerms">用户协议</view>
  </view>

  <view class="copyright">Copyright 2026 银领时代团队</view>
</view>
